/Title (Healthcare organizations are increasingly deploying RAG-based AI systems that access sensitive patient information. While these systems rely on system prompts and safety instructions to protect data, there is often no automated mechanism to verify whether these safeguards can withstand adversarial attacks such as prompt injection, jailbreaks, impersonation, or PHI extraction attempts.)
